{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":25,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"11f32cc0-f415-4567-ae40-a512d460a3b2","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151242054,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"存储IP设计工程师","OrgId":3250151,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.参与存储IP（MTP/OTP/eflash等)外围模拟电路包括电荷泵、灵敏放大器、读写控制电路、参考源等模块以及阵列编解码电路的设计、仿真以及优化；\n2.根据存储容量、速度、性能等需求，定义设计架构和外围模拟电路设计的关键参数;\n3.主导存储IP的设计开发，协调数字控制逻辑与版图实现，确保IP性能和良率；\n4.在电路设计、测试失效分析中起主导作用，协助解决客户在IP使用中遇到的问题；\n5.指导版图工程师完成存储阵列周边的高压器件、匹配布局及隔离设计；\n6.对客户、FAE、销售提供存储IP技术支持。","Require":"1.硕士及以上学历，微电子、材料或物理等相关专业，有存储或非易失性存储器模拟电路设计经验优先；\n2.具有深厚的模拟IC及半导体物理基础，熟悉浮栅/电荷阱器件特性，掌握高压电路设计、低功耗读取技术峰，熟悉可靠性分析测试方法；\n3.熟练使用Cadence Virtuoso、Spectre及相关仿真工具；\n4.有MTP/OTP/eflash等存储IP多次成功量产经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"1","ChangeDate":"2026-09-07T10:46:07","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"e5a0df5d-fbff-4277-8eed-